            "Custom `__eq__` in a frozen class: auto hash uses __all__ fields, so equal objects can hash differently"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
